\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" going to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"leave?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "chat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "talk; conversation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So great to have a chat with you!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about a skiing trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a clothing accessory you wear on your head", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm taking a hat, goggles and gloves with me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "goggles", "type": "name"}, {"content": "glasses for skiing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to buy a pair of goggles to go skiing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gloves", "type": "name"}, {"content": "protection from the cold for the hands", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's cold. You need your gloves.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "skis", "type": "name"}, {"content": "long thin boards used for skiing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to rent skis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "poles", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sticks used for skiing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "noun", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I use your poles today?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a destination for a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of 10 items you would normally take.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write each item on a separate piece of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give your partner 10 seconds to look at all the pieces of papers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner closes their eyes. You remove 2 items.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to guess which items are missing. These are the items you need to get.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss how to get those things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles and repeat.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify items for a trip. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss things I need to take on a trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le04ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le04ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "1", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hi Vanessa!  So great to have a chat with you!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  How's it going?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Amazing!  On Friday, I'm going to the French Alps for a ski weekend.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Nice! Are you going to buy ski equipment?"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, I'm going to rent skis, boots and poles. I'm going to take my own hat, goggles and gloves.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Who are you going to go with?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going with this cute guy I met on my bike tour of Paris.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Ooh la la!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How is cooking school?"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "33000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Great! We're preparing Italian dishes right now. Tomorrow we're going to make lasagna.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yummy! What are you going to do after that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We're going to learn Indian recipes. Where are you going next?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going to Spain. Do you want some ideas for tapas?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Absolutely!"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le04ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le04ob09re6aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn4le04ob09re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about things to take and do on a trip.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about intentions and plans.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Where do you like to go for a trip?  Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "I can ask who, what, when, where questions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What do you bring with you?", "type": "Free He